OL,3,GNEWSACommissioner vows to end modern
OL,4,Aslavery in county
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridgeshire's Police and Crime
OL,7,FCommissioner says he is committed to
OL,8,Feradicating modern slavery and human
OL,9,Ftrafficking from the county.
OL,11,FDarryl Preston joined Chief Constable
OL,12,FSimon Megicks in signing a refreshed
OL,13,FModern Slavery Statement at a recent
OL,14,Fpolice accountability meeting.
OL,16,FThe document outlines measures designed
OL,17,Fto prevent modern slavery, forced
OL,18,Flabour, human trafficking and
OL,19,Fexploitation within the force and its
OL,20,Fsupply chains.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
