OL,3,GNEWSACommissioner vows to end modern
OL,4,Aslavery in county
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreston said: "When we talk about
OL,7,Fslavery it is, to many,
OL,8,Fincomprehensible that it exists in our
OL,9,Fcounty, but it is unfortunately very
OL,10,Fmuch an issue."
